  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 30781,
  "published": "2026-10-26T10:02:47.65Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (breaking): pipelines are now created with PipelineBuilder<TModel>().Build() instead of Pipeline<TModel>().CreatePipeline(); steps and compensations return Task<TModel>; a failed run throws PipelineException with the step's exception as OriginalException. Added: OnFailure action, CompensationStrategy (ContinueOnFailure, StopOnFirstFailure), and failure details on PipelineException. Fixed: a compensation that threw made ExecuteAsync hang. Full notes and upgrade guide: https://github.com/pavlek1817/jag-pipeline/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
